[b]Welcome, lords and ladies of KINGDOMS![/b]
Today's update content was initially set a bit later on the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/409590/discussions/13/3058491773343925487/]roadmap[/url], but after previous update, when marriage proposals were added, I decided to move it. From now on player can add any settler with >10 friendship to the journal. Found good teacher? Write his name to journal. Found someone useful? Add to journal as well! Family member are in the list by default, but the rest of the list can be changed - there are 3 types of marked settlers - family (is added automatically), teachers and friends (player adds them using dialog option). I'm sure this feature will be very useful for the players, especially in finding teachers.
Now to the fixes. The main one is the fix for female character who couldn't make proper relationship with male settlers. Fixed. Plus I've fixed issue with F button for AZERTY users. The rest of changes/fixes follows:

