[*]Now player can add settlers to journal tracking list;
[*]Added settler can be found in Inventory >> Journal >> Tracking >> Settlers;
[*]Family will be added to tracking list by default;
[*]Player can add settler as a teacher;
[*]Player can add settler to journal as a friend;
[*]Settler can be eased from the journal as well;
[*]Settler can be added to journal only if friendship is higher than 10;
[*]New quest was added "Wife asks for flowers";
[/list]
[b]FIXES[/b]
[list]
[*]Fixed issue when wife didn't live in husband's house sometimes;
[*]"F" key is no more responsible for taking weapons away - should be useful for AZERTY users;
[*]Quest "Baker asks to kill a baker was fixed";
[*]Fixed issue when female character couldn't make any relationship interactions with male characters; 
[*]Fixed issue when female character couldn't make a marriage proposal to male character;
[*]Fixed issue when family name was sometimes changed incorrect after marriage;
[*]Fixed issue when female couldn't marry female when "semi couples" option is on;
[*]Fixed issue when game loading could stuck in the middle of roads calculation sometimes;
[/list]
[b]LOCALIZATIONS[/b]
[list]
[*]Russian translation was updated;
