[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/10455751/b92f2638582786c4f601008210d20f7b3f0fc2c4.jpg[/img]
  - Everything is done automatically, including making screenshot, gathering PC specs and sending a save file;
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/10455751/ed85b351771233090c455ae5eaa9d952d2efbaaf.jpg[/img]

[b]NEW CHARACTER CONTROLLER[/b]
  - Smooth camera movement, no more shaking;
  - Various camera effects like sword swinginfg, falling by jumping etc.
  - New chopping system;
  - New harvesting system;
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/10455751/e294993c87b9f8bb3dcddfae45ebe01c3406b449.jpg[/img]
